# Gurmag Rakshasa ({4}{B}{B}, 5/5 menace): "When this creature enters, target creature an opponent controls gets -2/-2 until end
# of turn and target creature you control gets +2/+2 until end of turn." Bot1 kills Bot2's Memnite (1/1 becomes -1/-1) and grows
# the Rakshasa itself to 7/7 (it is a legal "creature you control" as the ability is put on the stack, CR 603.3d). The bonus ends
# at cleanup (CR 514.2). On turn 5 Bot2's lone Ornithopter cannot block it (menace, CR 702.110b), so Bot2 takes 5.

